 "about": "EQeq charges for the P1 cell of resources/samples/cod/MOF-5.cif (COD 1516287, CC0), in the order xtal.core.p1.expand gives its atoms, computed by the authors' own program: numat/EQeq main.cpp at commit 64bcfdd9c23f (2021-05-21), with that repository's ionizationdata.dat and chargecenters.dat, run as 'eqeq MOF-5.cif 1.2 -2.0 6' (lambda 1.2, hydrogen affinity -2.0 eV, six decimals, its default Ewald settings). The same build gives the paper's published IRMOF-1 charges exactly (Zn 1.211, O -0.968 and -0.483). Numbers only: no code or table from that GPL repository is in this one.",
